msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/codecClassFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "codecClass is functional"
msgstr "codecClass 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/codecClassFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:codecClass is functional: a gmeow:TransformCodec has exactly one capability class — the single kind of thing a reader must hold to reverse it, a library or a key, never both at once."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:codecClass 是函数式的：一个 gmeow:TransformCodec 恰好有一个能力类别——读取者要将其还原所必须持有的唯一一种事物，即一个库或一把密钥，而绝不会同时是两者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gtsHeadIdFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "gtsHeadId is functional"
msgstr "gtsHeadId 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gtsHeadIdFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:gtsHeadId is functional: a gmeow:GTSSegment has exactly one chain head — the single content-id of its last frame, written 'blake3:<hex>', which transitively commits to the segment's entire frame history."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:gtsHeadId 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:GTSSegment 恰好有一个链头——其最后一帧的唯一内容标识,记作 'blake3:<hex>',它以传递方式承诺该分段的整个帧历史。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gtsProfileFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "gtsProfile is functional"
msgstr "gtsProfile 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gtsProfileFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:gtsProfile is functional: a gmeow:GTSSegment declares exactly one profile — a single value-vocabulary individual naming its purpose and requirement set, while a multi-segment document's effective requirements are the derived union of its segments' profiles rather than a second value on one segment."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:gtsProfile 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:GTSSegment 恰好声明一个配置——一个值词汇表中的单一个体,用于命名其目的和需求集合——而一份多分段文档的有效需求是其各分段配置的派生并集,而不是在单个分段上设置第二个值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gtsSegmentHeadKey|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "a GTS segment is keyed by its chain head"
msgstr "GTS 分段以其链头作为键"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gtsSegmentHeadKey|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts that a gmeow:GTSSegment is identified by its gmeow:gtsHeadId: the chain head is a BLAKE3 content-id committing transitively to the segment's entire frame history, so two distinct segments sharing a head would be a full-history BLAKE3 collision — impossible by construction. The head therefore uniquely identifies its segment (content-addressing IS the identity), and the native DL consistency gate forces two segments asserted distinct yet sharing a head into owl:Nothing. Stated as a key (the logic: analogue of owl:hasKey, OWL 2 DL) rather than an inverse-functional characteristic, which on the datatype property gmeow:gtsHeadId would be OWL 2 Full."
msgstr "断言一个 gmeow:GTSSegment 由其 gmeow:gtsHeadId 标识:链头是一个 BLAKE3 内容标识,它以传递方式承诺该分段的整个帧历史,因此两个共享同一链头的不同分段将构成一次覆盖全部历史的 BLAKE3 碰撞——依构造而言这是不可能的。因此链头唯一标识其分段(内容寻址即身份),原生 DL 一致性关卡会将两个被断言为不同却共享链头的分段强制归入 owl:Nothing。此处以键(logic: 中 owl:hasKey 的对应物,OWL 2 DL)的形式表述,而非逆函数特性——若用于数据类型属性 gmeow:gtsHeadId 上,逆函数特性将属于 OWL 2 Full。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gtsSegmentIndexFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "gtsSegmentIndex is functional"
msgstr "gtsSegmentIndex 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gtsSegmentIndexFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:gtsSegmentIndex is functional: a gmeow:GTSSegment occupies exactly one zero-based position in its document's file order — a single index, the ordered list of which forms the document's composite identity."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:gtsSegmentIndex 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:GTSSegment 在其文档的文件顺序中恰好占据一个从零开始的位置——一个单一的索引,这些索引的有序列表构成文档的复合身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gtsSegmentOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "gtsSegmentOf is functional"
msgstr "gtsSegmentOf 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/gtsSegmentOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:gtsSegmentOf is functional: a gmeow:GTSSegment instance belongs to exactly one document — the same bytes appearing in another file are a different segment instance of the same content, not a second document on one segment."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:gtsSegmentOf 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:GTSSegment 实例恰好属于一个文档——同样的字节出现在另一个文件中,是同一内容的另一个分段实例,而不是一个分段对应两个文档。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/opacityReasonFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "opacityReason is functional"
msgstr "opacityReason 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/opacityReasonFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:opacityReason is functional: a gmeow:OpaqueFrame has exactly one reason for its opacity — a single cause, an encrypt-class codec without a key, a codec the reader lacks, or damage, since opacity without a stated reason would be indistinguishable from data loss."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:opacityReason 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:OpaqueFrame 恰好有一个不透明原因——单一成因,可能是缺少密钥的加密类编解码器、读取方所不具备的编解码器,或是损坏,因为没有说明原因的不透明将与数据丢失无法区分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/opaqueFrameInFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "opaqueFrameIn is functional"
msgstr "opaqueFrameIn 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/opaqueFrameInFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:opaqueFrameIn is functional: a gmeow:OpaqueFrame belongs to exactly one segment — a frame occupies a single position in one segment's chain."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:opaqueFrameIn 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:OpaqueFrame 恰好属于一个片段——一帧在某一个片段的链中占据单一位置。"
